Z||000004||AkursedX||06-19-2001||01:25 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex2004:<BR><B>I LOVE YOUR CAR! it's awesome and i love your wheel's, what kind are those, they are awesome...<P>Alex...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They are 17inch Konig Tantrums.  The fronts are 17x7 and the rears are 17x8.  They have Kuhmo Ecsta Supra 712's on them.  215/45 on the front 235/45 on the rear<P>||||reg||1
