Z||000021||85blackgt||06-19-2001||11:17 PM||||man nice car!! beutiful interior if you get a spoiler the car is made!!! hey i don't know much about sound systems but what does 45w/2 mean on the amp?||||reg||1
Z||000022||AkursedX||06-19-2001||11:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85blackgt:<BR><B>man nice car!! beutiful interior if you get a spoiler the car is made!!! hey i don't know much about sound systems but what does 45w/2 mean on the amp?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It's actually 200watts max per channel. (in the top right of the amp, it says that )  and it's a 2 channel amp, so i get 400 watts max power, because i have both channels bridged into one.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
